{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","自然之怒"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","自然の怒り"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","创造持续数秒的乌云，降下雷电打击敌人。敌人处于控制状态时，敌人会受到更多次雷击。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","持続する黒雲を召喚して雷撃を与える。敵が行動阻害状態の場合、さらに複数回の雷撃を与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个地图格，对该格2格范围内的所有敌人造成160% + 20% ATK伤害，同时在该范围上空生成持续7秒的乌云，乌云会雷击下方处于控制状态的敌人，造成80% + 10% ATK伤害。同一名敌人每2秒最多被雷击1次。优先选择敌军最密集的区域释放。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","マスを1つ選び、周囲2マス以内の敵全体に160% + 20% ATKのダメージを与え、その範囲の上空に7秒間持続する黒雲を生成。黒雲は下にいる行動阻害状態の敵に雷撃を放ち、80% + 10% ATKのダメージを与える。敵1体につき、2秒ごとに1回まで雷撃可能。敵が最も密集しているエリアを優先的に選択してスキルを発動"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":80,"end":86,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":89,"end":95,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":77,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":86,"end":99,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","首次雷击造成180% + 20% ATK伤害，乌云后续雷击造成90% + 10% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","1回目の雷撃が180% + 20% ATKのダメージ、それ以降は90% + 10% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start"